                <pb facs="0268" n="172" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg172"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 11.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Imperial decree published in the Pekin Gazette July 9,
                        1900.</hi></head>
                <p>We appoint Li Hung Chang viceroy of the province of Chihli and superintendent of
                    northern trade. As the guarding of Tientsin is at present of the most
                    importance, we direct that until the arrival of Li Hung Chang, Yu Lu, in concert
                    with Sung Cheng, deliberate as to the best measures to be taken. Pending the
                    change of officers there must be no slackening of responsibility.</p>
            </div>
